    Key Concepts in GenAI

      Tokenization
          > Breaking test into samaller units (tokens) for processing
          > For example : The tokens for text "Generative AI in testing: could be ["Gener" "ative", "AI", "in", "Testing"]
          > A helpful rule of thumb is that one token generally corresponds to ~ 4 characters of text for common English text

        Context Window:
          > The context window (or "context length") of a LLM is the amount of text, in tokens, that the model can consider or "remember" at any one time.
          > For exampele, a model may only "remember" the last 2-3 paragraphs of conversation

        Multimodal Models
          > Can handle multiple data types (text, images, video etc)
          > For example, if you upload a bug screenshot and description for bug the AI can suggest possible fixes.

